      "comment": "OUTWITTED (5) brings the strongest winning case after scoring at this track in a 3yo+ Class 5, despite being unwanted in the market. He beat Moochi Starlight by a nose, has two wins and a placing from five starts at this track and distance, and Ashley Butler has an excellent record on him. MISS FUNNY HONEY (6) is the main danger back from a FM Benchmark 78 at Gold Coast, where she was safely held over 1400m, but her previous Class 3 third at Sunshine Coast on soft ground was sound and the return to 1200m suits. UNDERRATED (7) resumes with a consistent local profile, having ended last campaign with a third to Wolfgang at this venue after being bumped at the start and a nose second the run prior. TIZSO FAB (1) comes through Open grade and is proven at this track and distance, so he appeals as a genuine place chance if sharper off the freshening.",
